Subject: [PATCH] Add test scenarios: run scenarios, raise issues from steps,
 re-test, sign-off

- Scenario library with Excel import (one row per step, grouped by Scenario ID)
- Test runs per build, assignment to testers and business users
- Step-by-step execution with Pass/Fail/Blocked/N/A, actual result and evidence
- Raise an issue from a failed step, pre-filled and linked; or link an existing one
- Deploy new build: mark issues fixed, linked scenarios return as re-tests;
  finishing a re-test verifies (closes) or reopens the issue
- LOB sign-off by business, run progress board and Excel report
- GitHub Actions build workflow

